  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.37 - AM001 exact numeric conversion modelling\n\n            Changed:\n            - AM001 numeric compatibility now follows the C# implicit numeric conversion table instead of an artificial widening level\n            - AM001 now reports double/float to decimal property mappings that require explicit casts\n            - AM001 keeps char-to-numeric widening mappings quiet when C# permits the implicit conversion\n            - Added analyzer and code-fix regression coverage for exact numeric conversion boundaries\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 (832 tests)\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - GitHub PR checks passing\n            - git diff --check clean\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.36 - AM002 generic nullability flow hardening",
